{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-dependencies","title":"共享依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/shared-dependencies","wordCount":699,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"共享依赖管理\">共享依赖管理</h1><p>微前端架构中，共享依赖是一个两难博弈：完全不共享会导致用户下载多份 React/Vue 等基础库（50KB+ 重复加载），完全共享则重新引入了版本耦合和协调成本。本文系统讲解 2026 年主流的共享策略，以及 Module Federation 2.0 的 Tree Shaking 如何打破这个两难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>共享依赖的本质问题是：多个独立构建的子应用如何在运行时协商并使用同一份库代码？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Host 加载 React 19.1] --&gt; B{子应用 A 需要 React}&#10;    B --&gt;|版本兼容| C[复用 Host 的 React]&#10;    B --&gt;|版本不兼容| D[加载独立 React]&#10;    A --&gt; E{子应用 B 需要 React}&#10;    E --&gt;|版本兼容| C&#10;    E --&gt;|版本不兼容| F[加载独立 React]&#10;    C --&gt; G[单例 React]&#10;    D --&gt; H[多版本并存]&#10;    F --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[Host 加载 React 19.1] --&gt; B{子应用 A 需要 React}\n    B --&gt;|版本兼容| C[复用 Host 的 React]\n    B --&gt;|版本不兼容| D[加载独立 React]\n    A --&gt; E{子应用 B 需要 React}\n    E --&gt;|版本兼容| C\n    E --&gt;|版本不兼容| F[加载独立 React]\n    C --&gt; G[单例 React]\n    D --&gt; H[多版本并存]\n    F --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"共享策略分层\">共享策略分层</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略层级</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>适用库类型</th>\n<th>典型代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构建时 externals</td>\n<td>打包时排除，运行时从全局获取</td>\n<td>框架层</td>\n<td>Webpack externals</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Import Maps</td>\n<td>浏览器原生模块映射</td>\n<td>任意 ESM</td>\n<td>Single-SPA 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MF shared 协议</td>\n<td>运行时版本协商</td>\n<td>所有 npm 包</td>\n<td>Module Federation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npm 包发布</td>\n<td>各自安装，允许重复</td>\n<td>工具库</td>\n<td>lodash、dayjs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"module-federation-的-shared-配置详解\">Module Federation 的 shared 配置详解</h2><p>MF 的 shared 协议是最精细的共享机制，支持版本协商、单例强制、按需降级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;  shared: {&#10;    // 强制单例（多版本并存会 crash 的库）&#10;    react: {&#10;      singleton: true, // 全局只加载一份&#10;      requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39;, // 声明兼容范围&#10;      eager: false, // 异步加载（推荐）&#10;    },&#10;    &#39;react-dom&#39;: {&#10;      singleton: true,&#10;      requiredVersion: &#39;^19.0.0&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    // 允许多版本（各子应用可用不同版本）&#10;    lodash: {&#10;      singleton: false,&#10;      requiredVersion: &#39;^4.17.0&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    // 业务组件库：singleton + strictVersion&#10;    &#39;@company/design-system&#39;: {&#10;      singleton: true,&#10;      strictVersion: true, // 版本不匹配直接报错&#10;      requiredVersion: &#39;^3.0.0&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 强制单例（多版本并存会 crash 的库）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    react: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 全局只加载一份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 声明兼容范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      eager: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 异步加载（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'react-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 允许多版本（各子应用可用不同版本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lodash: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^4.17.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 业务组件库：singleton + strictVersion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '@company/design-system'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      strictVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 版本不匹配直接报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^3.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"版本协商算法\">版本协商算法</h3><p>运行时协商逻辑：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Host 声明自己有 <code>react@19.1.0</code></li>\n<li>Remote A 请求 <code>react ^19.0.0</code> → 满足 → 复用</li>\n<li>Remote B 请求 <code>react ^18.0.0</code> → 不满足 → 根据 singleton 设置决定<ul>\n<li><code>singleton: true</code>：强制使用 Host 版本（可能 break）</li>\n<li><code>singleton: false</code>：加载 Remote B 自带的 18.x 版本</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"tree-shaking-实战\">Tree Shaking 实战</h3><p>2026 年 MF 2.0 稳定版引入的 shared tree shaking：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"new ModuleFederationPlugin({&#10;  shared: {&#10;    antd: { singleton: true, requiredVersion: &#39;^5.0.0&#39; },&#10;    &#39;@ant-design/icons&#39;: { singleton: true },&#10;  },&#10;  treeShaking: true, // 开启 shared 依赖的 tree shaking&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModuleFederationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shared: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    antd: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, requiredVersion: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^5.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '@ant-design/icons'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { singleton: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  treeShaking: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 开启 shared 依赖的 tree shaking</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>效果示意：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件库</th>\n<th>无 Tree Shaking</th>\n<th>有 Tree Shaking</th>\n<th>体积减少</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Ant Design（使用 3 个组件）</td>\n<td>1404 KB</td>\n<td>344 KB</td>\n<td>75.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material UI（使用 5 个组件）</td>\n<td>892 KB</td>\n<td>267 KB</td>\n<td>70.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chart.js（使用 2 种图表）</td>\n<td>445 KB</td>\n<td>128 KB</td>\n<td>71.2%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"import-maps-方案\">Import Maps 方案</h2><p>对于不使用 Module Federation 的项目（如 Single-SPA 生态），Import Maps 是标准的共享方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;script type=&quot;importmap&quot;&gt;&#10;  {&#10;    &quot;imports&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;react&quot;: &quot;https://cdn.example.com/react@19.1.0/esm/index.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;react-dom&quot;: &quot;https://cdn.example.com/react-dom@19.1.0/esm/index.js&quot;,&#10;      &quot;vue&quot;: &quot;https://cdn.example.com/vue@3.5.0/dist/vue.esm-browser.js&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"importmap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    \"imports\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      \"react\": \"https://cdn.example.com/react@19.1.0/esm/index.js\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      \"react-dom\": \"https://cdn.example.com/react-dom@19.1.0/esm/index.js\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      \"vue\": \"https://cdn.example.com/vue@3.5.0/dist/vue.esm-browser.js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>版本升级流程：修改 Import Map → 所有子应用自动使用新版本。无需重新构建任何子应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-内的依赖提升\">Monorepo 内的依赖提升</h2><p>当微前端项目使用 monorepo 管理时，pnpm workspace 的 <code>catalog</code> 功能可以统一管理依赖版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;catalog:&#10;  react: &#39;^19.1.0&#39;&#10;  react-dom: &#39;^19.1.0&#39;&#10;  typescript: &#39;^5.8.0&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">catalog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  react</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.1.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  react-dom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^19.1.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  typescript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^5.8.0'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>所有子应用通过 <code>catalog:</code> 协议引用统一版本，避免 lockfile 中出现多版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"依赖重复检测与治理\">依赖重复检测与治理</h2><p>定期检查运行时是否加载了重复依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 运行时检测脚本（开发环境）&#10;const loadedModules = performance&#10;  .getEntriesByType(&#39;resource&#39;)&#10;  .filter((r) =&gt; r.name.includes(&#39;node_modules&#39;))&#10;  .map((r) =&gt; r.name);&#10;&#10;const duplicates = findDuplicatePackages(loadedModules);&#10;if (duplicates.length &gt; 0) {&#10;  console.warn(&#39;[MF] 检测到重复依赖:&#39;, duplicates);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 运行时检测脚本（开发环境）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> loadedModules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntriesByType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resource'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.name.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node_modules'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> duplicates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findDuplicatePackages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(loadedModules);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (duplicates.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[MF] 检测到重复依赖:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, duplicates);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MF 2.0 的 Chrome DevTools 扩展可以可视化展示 shared 依赖的复用情况和重复加载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>框架库（React/Vue）必须 singleton 共享</li>\n<li>工具库（lodash/dayjs）允许多版本以保证独立性</li>\n<li>MF 2.0 的 Tree Shaking 彻底解决了「共享 = 全量加载」的历史问题</li>\n<li>Import Maps 是不依赖打包器的标准共享方案</li>\n<li>定期用 DevTools/检测脚本审计重复依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 下一篇：<a href=\"build-deploy-pipeline\">构建与部署流水线</a> — 多应用的 CI/CD 编排</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../build-tooling-bundlers/optimization/tree-shaking\">构建工具 hub — Tree Shaking</a> — Tree Shaking 的底层机制（DCE + Side Effect 标记）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"共享依赖管理","id":"共享依赖管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"共享策略分层","id":"共享策略分层"},{"level":2,"text":"Module Federation 的 shared 配置详解","id":"module-federation-的-shared-配置详解"},{"level":3,"text":"版本协商算法","id":"版本协商算法"},{"level":3,"text":"Tree Shaking 实战","id":"tree-shaking-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"Import Maps 方案","id":"import-maps-方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 内的依赖提升","id":"monorepo-内的依赖提升"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖重复检测与治理","id":"依赖重复检测与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Web Components 与边缘组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/web-components-approach"},"next":{"title":"构建与部署流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/build-deploy-pipeline"}}